    "body": "A block_policy_estimates.dat whose bucket list lacks the infinite last bucket makes a later feerate lookup read past the end of the bucket map.\n\nThe estimator relies on the last bucket being infinite, so that every feerate finds a bucket. I reject a list whose first bucket is not positive, that does not strictly increase, or that does not end with the infinite bucket. I tested this with a new unit test that changes one bucket of a valid file at a time. It fails without the change and passes with it.\n",
