      "message": "fees: validate buckets read from estimates file\n\nA block_policy_estimates.dat whose bucket list lacks the infinite last\nbucket makes a later feerate lookup read past the end of the bucket map.\n\nThe estimator relies on the last bucket being infinite, so that every\nfeerate finds a bucket. I reject a list whose first bucket is not\npositive, that does not strictly increase, or that does not end with the\ninfinite bucket. I tested this with a new unit test that changes one\nbucket of a valid file at a time. It fails without the change and passes\nwith it.",
